      "observation": "Third-party reported scores differ substantially across device profiles, so high desktop performance does not establish mobile readiness.",
      "vsn_original_action": "Media art direction, avoid loading offscreen heavy video/slideshow assets upfront, respect reduced motion and keep DOM complexity controlled.",
